Climate Downscaling Lab
Research code assembled for Hossein Yousefi Sohi and collaborators.

This repository includes and adapts CorrDiff example code and other components
from NVIDIA PhysicsNeMo. Their original copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are
retained in the source files. The bundled PhysicsNeMo patch must be applied to
the exact upstream commit recorded in patches/physicsnemo-source.json.

The code license does not license third-party datasets or model checkpoints.
Data access remains subject to the source providers' conditions. No datasets,
model weights, prediction arrays, manuscript files, or research results are
included in this repository.

Repository-specific changes include portable paths, common workflow interfaces,
explicit scientific processing policies, corrected missing-data handling,
verification tools, and automated tests. Historical variants are identified
separately; their presence is not a claim that known processing defects are
scientifically valid or that all historical checkpoints can be recovered.
